,"kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001892","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0560","start":560,"end":562,"surface":"叔向","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002010","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:p001","text":"管仲夷吾者，潁上人也。少時常與鮑叔牙游，鮑叔知其賢。管仲貧困，常欺鮑叔，鮑叔終善遇之，不以為言。已而鮑叔事齊公子小白，管仲事公子糾。及小白立為桓公，公子糾死，管仲囚焉。鮑叔遂進管仲。管仲既用，任政於齊，齊桓公以霸，九合諸侯，一匡天下，管仲之謀也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"管仲夷吾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003701","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"鮑叔牙","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003702","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"鮑叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003702","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003701","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"鮑叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003702","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"鮑叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003702","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"鮑叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003702","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0053","start":53,"end":58,"surface":"齊公子小白","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003703","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003701","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0062","start":62,"end":65,"surface":"公子糾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003704","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"小白","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003703","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003703","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0074","start":74,"end":77,"surface":"公子糾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003704","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003701","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"鮑叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003702","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003701","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003701","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0101","start":101,"end":104,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003703","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或未定指代；不補姓名、成員與特定齊君。"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:m001-0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003701","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan","book_id":"b-shiji-062","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-062-guanyan"},{"id":"c-shiji-062-guanyan:p002","text":"管仲曰：「吾始困時，嘗與鮑叔賈，分財利多自與，鮑叔不以我為貪，知我貧也。吾嘗為鮑叔謀事而更窮困，鮑叔不以我為愚，知時有利不利也。吾嘗三仕三見逐於君，鮑叔不以我為不肖，知我不遭時也。吾嘗三戰三走，鮑叔不以我怯，知我有老母也。公子糾敗，召忽死之，吾幽囚受辱，鮑叔不以我為無恥，知我不羞小節而恥功名不顯于天下也。生我者父母，知我者鮑子也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_